  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经突破了整合运动的拦截！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是——他们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "嘘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......别让阿米娅她们听见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "阿米娅心里清楚得很！她比我们想象的成熟得多......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "就算这样，也不能让她听见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "再去加深她内心的煎熬是不明智的。她已经背负......太多东西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......不要让......他们的努力白费！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "既然他们让我们活下来，我们就应该让博士和阿米娅......安全回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "还不是垂头丧气的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "作为耀骑士，无论在什么时候，都该成为指引众人的光吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "——我不清楚。但，我会去做我该做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "重整队形！不要懈怠！我们就快到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "嘴里说着让我放心的人，真的一个都没回来过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "{@nickname}博士......？发生了......什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "请，请放我......放我下来吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，没问题我可以自己走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我只是......失去意识了一会儿......没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我们逃出来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ace他们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "是嘛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "没关系的。如果是Ace的话，一定没问题的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "罗德岛的大家，都是很强的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "已经，快到南方出口了。只要撤出切尔诺伯格，我们就......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我们......就......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "博士......能......让我靠一下吗......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "一下......一下就好......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "————"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "难缠。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "竟然......能，能做到这一步......这家伙......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "半个街区被烧成焦炭，整个广场都陷入火海......钢铁被融化又重新凝固......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
          "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
          "text": "但他为什么......还能战斗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "奋战至尸骨无存——了不起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "我记住了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "塔露拉",
          "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1",
          "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
          "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
          "text": "......罗德岛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
